    "detailed_description": "Wander through dark corridors, look into abandoned editing rooms, penetrate dusty archives and uncover the secrets of the movie studio and its employees.<br />\r\nCollect puzzle pieces: Study notes, letters, photos, listen to audio recordings to understand what happened on the set of the cursed movie.<br />\r\nSolve puzzles. Come face to face with fear: You'll encounter ghosts of the past, reanimated nightmares, and what lurks in the depths of the human subconscious.<br />\r\nYour actions matter: The choices you make will determine not only the fate of the protagonist, but also the fate of the dead actor's soul.<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nUnique atmosphere of psychological horror: Immerse yourself in the world of old movies, where the boundaries of reality are erased and fear takes shape and voice.<br />\r\nDeep plot with unexpected twists and turns: Uncover secrets, learn the truth about the cursed movie and the fate of the actor who gave his soul to it.<br />\r\nHigh-quality graphics and sound: Realistic picture and atmospheric sound create the effect of complete immersion, making you believe in the reality of what is happening.<br />\r\nThis is not just a game. It's a one-way ticket to a world where fear comes to life on film and you become its unwitting spectator. Do you dare to take your place in the audience?\u201d",
